From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: write downloads into the vault, with the spike's
 controls

A download goes into the folder the user gave the browser in the vault,
through encri-client's write, unless its URL asks for Fenix's own
writer, so one build measures both. EncriGateActivity opens the vault
and runs the spike's measurements over adb, with a server on the
phone's loopback to download from.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
